  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là độ dài cạnh hình vuông thứ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>n</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Cứ như thế, dãy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> lập thành cấp số nhân lùi vô hạn với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy tổng chu vi của tất cả các hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></semantics></math> khi quá trình chia lặp lại vô hạn lần là\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math>",
